; Animated main menu.
;   MainMenu (Control, full rect)
;     Background (Control) ....... 3% overscan + breathing (node scale, script-
;                                  driven); drives the parallax + mist shaders
;       Painting (TextureRect) ... painting sampled by menu_parallax.gdshader
;       MistBody (ColorRect) ..... depth-masked mist, pools in the far valley,
;                                  RIDES the parallax; additive violet
;       MistVeil (ColorRect) ..... faint front haze, barely rides, much fainter
;   <UI CanvasLayer added ABOVE Background in a later step — left empty>

